cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use this software, cite it using these metadata.
title: AdLife Lab
subtitle: >-
  A local-first synthetic consumer society and advertising simulation CLI
type: software
version: 0.1.0
date-released: "2026-09-22"
license: AGPL-3.0-only
repository-code: "https://github.com/mahanfatehian/adlife-sim"
abstract: >-
  A deterministic, event-sourced agent-based simulator of a small fictional
  consumer society for studying advertising exposure, memory, and word of
  mouth under fully reproducible conditions. All agents are fictional;
  results are synthetic and exploratory.
keywords:
  - agent-based-modeling
  - simulation
  - synthetic-audience
  - advertising
  - reproducibility
# NOTE: Fill in the author's name below before public citation. Per the
# project's specification, the repository owner edits this file to add their
# own name; the tooling deliberately does not guess it.
authors:
  - name: "(owner: fill in before publication)"
